videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Coma","overview":"A seguito di un incidente un giovane architetto si risveglia in una dimensione parallela che assomiglia vagamente alla realtà. Un mondo ambientato dai ricordi di persone in coma che, proprio come in un sogno, sono caotici e instabili. L’architetto dovrà interpretare e codificare le leggi dello spazio che regolano questa distopica realtà per riuscire a scappare e tornare nel mondo che conosceva.","tagline":"Ci sveglieremo mai?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Coma","overview":"A young and talented architect comes to his senses after a horrific accident only to find himself in the odd dystopian world. A world that is filled with the memories of all current coma patients. Just like a human memory this world is fragmental, chaotic and unstable. This is COMA: icecaps, rivers and cities can all exist in a space of a single room and laws of physics are no longer laws as they can be bent.","tagline":"Wake up to save everyone"},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"После аварии молодой талантливый архитектор приходит в себя в очень странном мире, лишь частично похожем на реальность. Ему предстоит выяснить, по каким законам существует это пространство, бороться за жизнь, встретить любовь, найти, наконец, выход в реальный мир и осознать его по-новому, поняв, что такое КОМА на самом деле.","tagline":"Нам нужно проснуться"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxg0mPRXG191bh0fph4fX1S9Lr4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ozUfK85XsZE6pQnU9vuz3vDADIJ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":430155,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxg0mPRXG191bh0fph4fX1S9Lr4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxg0mPRXG19